  "display_title": "Death is Mine",
  "description": "Yoon Ji-Ha, a struggling actor who’s been dreaming of winning people’s affection for six years, has never even passed an audition. Haunted by a mysterious illness that foretells misfortune, he feels increasingly isolated. But when Song Chae-Heon, a secretive, powerful agency director, offers to make him a star, Ji-Ha is torn on what to do. Despite Chae-Heon’s arrogance, Ji-Ha feels an inexplicable pull toward him. What does Chae-Heon truly want, and why is he fixated on Ji-Ha’s potential?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
